hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur rikaz [dafina] mein panchwan [hissa baitulmal ke liye wajib] hai.'"
"361","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur rikaz [mile hue dafine] mein panchwan [hissa wajib] hai.'"
"362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak ham ne tumhen ghodon aur ghulamon ke sadqe [zakat] se muaf farmaya hai.'"
"363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman par us ke ghulam mein aur na us ke ghode mein sadqa [zakat wajib] nahin.'"
"364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman par us ke ghulam aur us ke ghode mein sadqa [zakat wajib] nahin.'"
